-- statement:
--   A statement of the module `MIPRE.Foundations.OracularDecider` of the MIP\* = RE formalization (commit `70cbf1c` of vidick/MIPRE-formalization). The typed oracularized decider. Piece O4 of `planning/oracularization.md` (issue #189): the decider of the paper's typed oracularized verifier (`sec:orac-def`, `fig:oracle-decider`) as a total `CL.TypedDecider` over the three roles, whose acceptance law is O2's bit-string predicate `oraclePred`. The paper runs the input decider in its *timeout-counter form*, which halts within a bound `B_𝒟(n)` read off its description, and parses answers against that bound. The ambient model has no such form, and the detyping compiler needs a total typed decider, so the timeout is made explicit: an *index…
